    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that helps. i'm also worried about some weird little glitches we've been seeing in the beta—like random focus jumps or elements not being read in order. what are some common edge cases or hidden bugs that usually mess up screen reader flows?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
