      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Common edge cases to watch out for includeResponsive design breakages, JavaScript-heavy interactions, and poor keyboard navigation behavior around complex forms, such as auto-fill fields or dropdown menus. Another area of concern is when elements get incorrectly focused or can't be focused due to code repetition or excessive id selectors used. Additionally, falling elements or unclosed modal windows can disrupt screen reader navigation flows.",
